{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The USB-C adapter fits the practical connection needs behind my USB expansion card, display cable, and Ethernet adapter purchases, though I would first check whether my devices need it.",
    "The SSD enclosure fits my interest in adding useful capabilities to existing computer equipment, but it would only be relevant if I had a compatible spare drive."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The streaming sticks, speakers, and smart displays offer entertainment or voice-assistant features, while my purchases have mostly addressed specific connection and accessory needs.",
    "Buying a tablet mount did not mean I wanted a replacement tablet, and neither the camera nor the microSD cards solves a need I have identified."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in computer accessories seems to have been treated as interest in electronic gadgets generally.",
    "Several widely purchased devices appeared even though their popularity gives me no reason to need their features."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The recurring connection between my purchases is making existing equipment work with particular ports, networks, or peripherals.",
    "I shop infrequently for specific needs, so even a relevant accessory depends on compatibility and whether I currently have a use for it."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions partly recognized my interest in computer connectivity but stretched it into a broader appetite for electronic devices."
}"}
